    <item>
      <title>泰国拟禁止稀土开采化学品出口及过境以遏制河流砷污染，11 月 24 日与缅甸会谈</title>
      <link>https://111.230.153.15/news/?batch=smart-20261122-162600&amp;cat=finance&amp;event=evt_007200a1b8e5</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">smart-20261122-162600:evt_007200a1b8e5</guid>
